      "notes": "Both sources provide identical mission statement. Chinese: 输出审美，严选供应商，创造客户价值. English: Output aesthetics, strictly select suppliers, create customer value."
    },
    {
      "section_id": 3,
      "section_title": "Vision",
      "source_files": [
        "raw_data/company_overview.txt",
        "raw_data/values_summary_v2.json"
      ],
      "confidence": 0.8,
      "conflict_detected": true,
      "conflict_details": {
        "issue": "Two different vision statements found across source documents",
        "version_a": {
          "content": "Build a mutually inspiring creator paradise; Shape a group of brands beloved by female consumers (打造一个相互激发的创作者乐园；塑造一批深受女性消费者喜爱的品牌)",
          "sources": ["raw_data/company_overview.txt"]
        },
        "version_b": {
          "content": "Build the largest online fashion marketplace for female consumers (打造全国最大的女性时尚线上市场)",
          "sources": ["raw_data/values_summary_v2.json"]
        },
        "resolution": "Version A (dual-dimensional vision) retained as primary. This version is more consistent with the company's creator-first philosophy and appears in the foundational company overview document. Version B appears to reflect a tactical/strategic goal rather than the aspirational vision, and is documented in the v2 revision notes as aligned with 'digital transformation objectives'.",
        "reasoning": "The dual-dimensional vision maintains the cultural and philosophical coherence of the company's identity. The marketplace vision may represent a business objective rather than the core vision statement. Version A is also supported by the creator philosophy which emphasizes building a 'creator paradise'.",
        "resolution_confidence": 0.8
      }
    },
    {
      "section_id": 4,
      "section_title": "Values",
      "source_files": [
        "raw_data/company_overview.txt",
        "raw_data/values_summary_v2.json"
      ],
      "confidence": 0.9,
      "conflict_detected": true,
      "conflict_details": {
        "issue": "Tier 1 Mindset values have a one-word difference between sources",
        "version_a": {
          "content": "合作、共赢、协同、赋能 (Cooperation, Win-win, Synergy, Empowerment)",
          "sources": ["raw_data/company_overview.txt"]
        },
        "version_b": {
          "content": "合作、创新、协同、赋能 (Cooperation, Innovation, Synergy, Empowerment)",
          "sources": ["raw_data/values_summary_v2.json"]
        },
        "resolution": "Version A (with 共赢/Win-win) retained as primary. This is supported by the company_overview.txt which provides more detailed context explaining each value. The values_summary_v2.json is a summary document and the 'Innovation' substitution may reflect a more recent but less fundamental change that was not fully vetted.",
        "reasoning": "'Win-win' (共赢) is more consistent with the collaborative philosophy expressed throughout the company's documentation. 'Innovation' while important, may be better understood as an outcome of the other four values rather than a core value itself. The company overview provides more comprehensive explanation suggesting it represents the more carefully considered version.",
        "resolution_confidence": 0.9
      }
    },
    {
      "section_id": 5,
      "section_title": "Slogan",
      "source_files": [
        "raw_data/company_overview.txt",
        "raw_data/team_collaboration.md",
        "raw_data/values_summary_v2.json",
        "raw_data/meeting_notes_q3.md"
      ],
      "confidence": 0.85,
      "conflict_detected": true,
      "conflict_details": {
        "issue": "Q3 2024 meeting notes indicate an approved slogan change",
        "version_a": {
          "content": "人人都可以是创作者 / Everyone can be a creator",
          "sources": ["raw_data/company_overview.txt", "raw_data/team_collaboration.md", "raw_data/values_summary_v2.json"]
        },
        "version_b": {
          "content": "人人天生都是设计师 / Everyone is born a designer",
          "sources": ["raw_data/meeting_notes_q3.md"]
        },
        "resolution": "Version A retained as official slogan. While meeting notes show approval for change, the values_summary_v2.json (dated September 2024, after the July meeting) still contains the original slogan, suggesting either the change was not implemented or remains in flux.",
        "reasoning": "The values_summary_v2.json is the most recent formal values documentation (September 2024) and still contains the original slogan. The meeting notes (July 2024) show discussion but the change may not have been finalized or rolled out. When in doubt, defer to the most recent formal documentation.",
        "resolution_confidence": 0.85
      }
    },
    {
